,"type":"album","name":"X: The Life and Times of Malcolm X","artist":"Anthony Davis /","year":1992,"weight":9,"yt":"1m9xzLx4kI0","src":"books,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Historia del jazz","title":"Historia del jazz (Ted Gioia)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":60045461525049,"name":"RYM Top — Experimental — Modern Creative","rank":189,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}}],"members":[],"member_of":[],"genres":[],"album_genres":[{"id":232030375633059,"type":"genre","name":"Third Stream","n":7},{"id":175947516841285,"type":"genre","name":"Modern Creative","n":4},{"id":18560543527384,"type":"genre","name":"Avant-Garde Jazz","n":3},{"id":163673912179753,"type":"genre","name":"Experimental Big Band","n":1},{"id":57121808568531,"type":"genre","name":"Big Band","n":1}],"labels":[],"album_labels":[],"own_scenes":[],"scenes":[{"id":267285796937001,"name":"Jazz posmoderno: Murray, el World Saxophone Quartet, Zorn y Frisell","book":"Historia del jazz","author":"Ted Gioia","start":1971,"end":2010,"desc":"Eclecticismo, desconstrucción, pastiche, parodia y performance: el jazz sigue el camino de las demás artes. Carla Bley mezcla free, fusión y clásica en Escalator Over the Hill; Steve Lacy reivindica a Monk; las sesiones Wildflowers retratan el Nueva York de los lofts; Air y Henry Threadgill van de Joplin a Ayler; John Carter narra la historia afroamericana en «Roots and Folklore»; Willem Breuker evoca a Weill y Brecht. David Murray, con ciento cincuenta discos antes de los cuarenta, quiere que la música «vuelva a tener swing»; el World Saxophone Quartet (Murray, Hemphill, Lake, Bluiett) toca sin sección rítmica de Ellington al free. John Zorn, warholiano, practica el zapping sonoro: game pieces (Cobra), Morricone, Naked City. Bill Frisell pinta paisajes en pastel. Joe Lovano tiende el puente con los tradicionalistas. El compromiso político se diluye y los clubes y sellos pasan a ser galerías que deciden las modas.","color":"#94a3b8","family":"Tradicionalistas y jazz contemporáneo","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/jazz/#posmodernos"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":143495004086596,"artist":"Anthony Davis","artist_id":129227484780823,"title":"X: The Life and Times of Malcolm X","year":1986,"ess":0,"yt":"41V40RIw2Cw","kind":null,"book":{"id":6,"title":"Historia del jazz","author":"Ted Gioia","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/jazz/"},"scene":"Jazz posmoderno: Murray, el World Saxophone Quartet, Zorn y Frisell","scene_id":267285796937001,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/jazz/#posmodernos","chapters":["Cap. 8: El free jazz y el jazz posmoderno"],"pages":[]}],"mentions":[{"book":"Historia del jazz","author":"Ted Gioia","page":397,"text":"…del jazz progresista. Estos últimos aspectos hacen sentir de vez en cuando su presencia en las obras posmodernas (como en la majestuosa ópera de Anthony Davis X: The Life and Times od Malcolm X), pero en su mayor parte la visión del jazz como una música con grandes «inquietudes sociales» ha disminuido…"},{"book":"Historia del jazz","author":"Ted Gioia","page":412,"text":"…Collins. Incluso dentro de los Estados Unidos, esta sensibilidad mundial ejerció una poderosa influencia. El músico de jazz americano de nacimiento Anthony Davis construyó complicadas composiciones de jazz basadas en una convergencia de las líneas minimalistas académicas y la tradicional música gamelan de…"},{"book":"Historia del jazz","author":"Ted Gioia","page":538,"text":"…(varios) illie the Weeper illow Tree illow Weep For Me itches and Devils (Ayler) ithout Your Love olverine Blues oodchopper’s Ball ork Song orkin’ (Davis) orktime (Rollins) ow The Life and Times of Malcolm X (Anthony Davis) ardbird Suite es, Indeed esterdays esternow onder Come the Blues ou Are Too Beautiful ou Understand our Father’s Moustache ou’re Just a No Account…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":158564634230784,"type":"album","name":"Of Blues and Dreams","list_id":60045461525049,"list":"RYM Top — Experimental — Modern Creative"